# LeakSanitizer suppressions for mariadb+columnstore under ASan.
#
# Each entry here is a known leak that is tracked separately and not worth
# blocking CI. Keep the list short and cite the follow-up ticket.

# ParseTree leak in buildEqualityPredicate: ParseTrees are pushed onto
# gp_walk_info::ptWorkStack and transferred into the execution plan. Some
# error-recovery paths clear ptWorkStack without deleting its contents.
# Fix requires porting ptWorkStack to std::unique_ptr<ParseTree>. TODO: file ticket.
leak:cal_impl_if::buildEqualityPredicate
